# Local / secrets — never commit
.env
.env.*
*.local
assets/private/
.DS_Store

# Engine local state: .pasco/local.toml may hold an absolute evidence root path
# (see docs/power-user-symlinks.md). Per-machine, never shared.
.pasco/

# Maintenance window ledger (issue-advance/issue-sprint): per-repo local state,
# written after a window. Never shared, and a tracked write would leave the tree
# dirty on the next session's boot (E_DIRTY_SESSION).
.agos/

# Harness / tooling artifacts
.pi/
node_modules/
*.log
